{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmonicord is a non-linear 2D adventure full of puzzles, rope-swinging, and shenanigans. Explore the nooks and crannies of a quiet woodland while befriending forest creatures, playing songs, and solving conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/091ec0311966b9c9b68bbcb611df80e4.poster.avif?t=1770608474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/091ec0311966b9c9b68bbcb611df80e4.webm?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/091ec0311966b9c9b68bbcb611df80e4.mp4?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">~</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Fortune's Hollow, once united around the magic that made the town prosperous, have long since been isolated from each other by infighting and misfortune. For the treasure-hunting raccoon Finnegan, this is a chance to claim an unguarded bounty.\u00a0But will his ambition survive his encounter with the desolate townsfolk and a noble minstrel who is intent on aiding them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/aaa5e285268eb333555a3ba672d3241f.poster.avif?t=1770608474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/aaa5e285268eb333555a3ba672d3241f.webm?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/aaa5e285268eb333555a3ba672d3241f.mp4?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover shady glades, sunny fields, lofty treetops, and dim tunnels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with (and pick up and throw) your animal companions to utilize unique abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox-style puzzles encourage you to discover your own solutions using your environment and the critters that accompany you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail\u00a0past obstacles\u00a0in fluid rope-swinging action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain objects beyond your reach using your trusty lasso.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play songs that take on a magic of their own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/89d3794ddf04283980cdcfe0ed696ef1.poster.avif?t=1770608474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/89d3794ddf04283980cdcfe0ed696ef1.webm?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/89d3794ddf04283980cdcfe0ed696ef1.mp4?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581070?t=1770608474","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/14e35c441ebb66d675cd5b65dd31ca1ddb396c9b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770608474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/d487fb78c019249cab2239b37d0c38151bf19641/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770608474","capsule_