laim an unguarded bounty.\u00a0But will his ambition survive his encounter with the desolate townsfolk and a noble minstrel who is intent on aiding them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/aaa5e285268eb333555a3ba672d3241f.poster.avif?t=1770608474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/aaa5e285268eb333555a3ba672d3241f.webm?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/aaa5e285268eb333555a3ba672d3241f.mp4?t=1770608474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover shady glades, sunny fields, lofty treetops, and dim tunnels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with (and pick up and throw) your animal companions to utilize unique abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox-style puzzles encourage you to discover your own solutions using your environment and the critters that accompany you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail\u00a0past obstacles\u00a0in fluid rope-swinging action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain objects beyond your reach using your trusty lasso.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play songs that take on a magic of their own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/89d3794ddf04283980cdcfe0ed696ef1.poster.avif?t=1770608474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581070/extras/89d3794ddf0